<title>USA: Keycorp says names Meyer president.</title>
<headline>Keycorp says names Meyer president.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>KeyCorp said Thursday its directors elected its chief operating offficer Henry Meyer III to the additional post of president.</p>
<p>Meyer continues to hold the title of chief operating officer and director, the bank said.</p>
<p>Robert Gillespie, who had been president, chairman and chief executive officer, retains the chairman and chief executive officer titles.</p>
</text>
